            "id": "obs-6",
            "text": "Disambiguated: the Vec length-1 timeout was a CBMC unwinding timeout, not a contract failure \u2014 a generic iterator loop unwound past 1150 iterations on a Vec bounded to 1",
            "timestamp": 1787494479257,
            "provenance": {
